    <h1 data-split-lines class="mt-3">At home in Emsland since 1969.<br><em class="serif-italic">Working underground worldwide.</em></h1>
    <p>LIBA – Lingener Baumaschinen is an owner-managed company from Lingen (Ems). We design and manufacture trench cutters deployed in over 60 countries for fibre optic, energy, utility and civil engineering projects.</p>
